~ start
OLLIE: [speed=1.1][shake rate=5 level=3][b]Noni! Come on! We have to get onto the roof![/b][/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.8][shake rate=5 level=3]I can't! It's too high![/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.1][shake rate=4 level=2]It's okay! I'll help you. Grab my hand![/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.8][shake rate=6 level=4]Kuya, I'm scared![/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=3 level=2]I know. Just hold on to me, okay?[/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=1.2][shake rate=10 level=6][b]Ah! Kuya, I'm slipping![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=1.2][shake rate=9 level=5][b]I've got you! Don't let go![/b][/shake][/speed]

NONI: [speed=0.7][shake rate=8 level=5][b]Kuya... don't leave me![/b][/shake][/speed]

OLLIE: [speed=0.8][shake rate=3 level=2]I won't, Noni. I promise.[/shake][/speed]
=> END